            title: 'Blue Moon',
            subtitle: 'Vying',
            content: [
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Blue Moon is a two-player German expandable card game by Reiner Knizia, published by Kosmos and Fantasy Flight Games, in which fantasy factions duel with asymmetric decks.',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Published in 2004, Blue Moon was later classified by Fantasy Flight Games within the living card game style of fixed-expansion card games rather than randomized boosters.',
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            title: 'Setup',
